{"v":2,"s":"m","w":9,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"Systems of two equations","b":"<p>A system has two unknowns and two equations; the solution is the pair (x, y) that satisfies both.</p><ul><li><b>Substitution</b> (zamena): express one unknown from one equation and put it into the other.</li><li><b>Elimination</b> (suprotni koeficijenti): multiply the equations so one unknown has opposite coefficients, then add them.</li></ul><div class=\"callout\">Two clues in a riddle: each alone isn’t enough, together they pin down the answer.</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Each equation is a line; the solution of the system is where they cross: x = 3, y = 1.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" class=\"k\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"10\" class=\"k\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"296\" y=\"154\" >x</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">y</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"70\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">1</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"100\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">2</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"130\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">3</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"160\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">4</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"190\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">5</text><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"220\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">6</text><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"250\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">7</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"143\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"280\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"9\">8</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"122\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"104\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"86\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"68\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"50\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"32\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><line x1=\"37\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"43\" y2=\"14\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"32\" y=\"17\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"end\">7</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"145\" y2=\"140\" class=\"kc\" /><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"32\" class=\"k\" /><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"122\" r=\"5\" class=\"bd\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"116\" font-weight=\"700\">(3, 1)</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"32\" class=\"acc\" font-size=\"11\">2x + y = 7</text><text x=\"244\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"11\">x − y = 2</text></svg><figcaption>Each equation is a line; the solution of the system is where they cross: x = 3, y = 1.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Word problems","b":"<ol><li>Name the unknowns: “let x be…”.</li><li>Translate each sentence into an equation.</li><li>Solve.</li><li>Check that the answer makes sense (no negative ages or −3 liters).</li></ol><p><b>Mixing problems</b> are chemistry in disguise: (amount of substance) = (percent) × (total).</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"2x + y = 7, x − y = 2","s":["Add the equations: y cancels → 3x = 9 → x = 3.","Put into x − y = 2: 3 − y = 2 → y = 1.","Check: 2·3 + 1 = 7 ✓"],"a":"x = 3, y = 1"},{"t":"num","q":"x + y = 12, x − y = 2. x = ?","a":7,"u":"","e":"2x = 14."},{"t":"num","q":"3x + 2y = 16 and x = 2y. x = ?","a":4,"u":"","e":"3x + x = 16 → x = 4."},{"t":"num","q":"How many liters of 20% solution must be mixed with 10 L of 50% solution to get 30%?","a":20,"u":"L","e":"0.2x + 5 = 0.3(x + 10) → 0.1x = 2 → x = 20."},{"t":"num","q":"Two numbers add up to 30, one is 4 more than the other. The larger?","a":17,"u":"","e":"x + x + 4 = 30 → x = 13, larger 17."},{"t":"mc","q":"x + y = 1 and x + y = 3:","o":["one solution","no solution","infinitely many"],"a":1,"e":"The same sum can’t be 1 and 3."}]}